      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Borger%2C_Texas",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "When oil struck in 1926, Borger quickly grew into a boomtown with steam power, a hotel, and a jail.",
