        10
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Borger%2C_Texas",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The town earned the nickname \"Booger Town\" during its early oil boom, a quirky moniker still remembered by locals.",
